  Emulator    JNext 1.2.0 headless, 2026-11-23/24: level ends 1 to 5 reach the
              next level and level 6 the ending; English debriefs, briefing
              titles (no Czech flash) and attract credits seen; Kempston
              joystick flies the ship in both languages (Y / A at the prompt);
              pilot SAVE, RAM wiped, LOAD read back from INFERNO.SAV in one
